## Closing Remarks
- The team emphasized the importance of restoring client trust and addressing internal workflow inefficiencies.
- Continued reliance on AI-driven features remains controversial among engineers and clients alike.
- Immediate priority is stabilizing the debugging functionality and preventing further escalations.

